{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "4fd246c6fa17d7c75723e30525ba9ab759e5d8683984f5422799b76385d0787f", "ja": "あっ、もうこんな時間かぁ。\n{$P$}さん、まだ戻らないのかな？", "zh": "啊，都已经这个时间了啊。\n{$P$}先生还没回来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1001_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7b4a3c80cdd1291a2485f2cdc4d0dcf846bfbfa4bc071b70ad1d205d6af95fd3", "ja": "はい……はい、いえ。こちらこそご無理を言って申し訳\nありません。すみませんがよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "是……是的，不，该说抱歉的是我才对。不好意思，给您添麻烦了。\n还请您多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1003_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "252d503d73703f5d28f8560644786c7674c575b6a7a922f2d7ec1e3f31e9e0fd", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おかえりなさい！\n帰ってきてすぐお仕事ですか？　お忙しそうですね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，欢迎回来！\n刚回来就马上要工作吗？看起来真忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9a9039389ddd3d7f4cf04ae03d9692b0783691a937730bacd95cf6d9b08143a8", "ja": "あ、青羽さん！　ありがとうございます。\n今日はなぜか、複数の予定が重なってしまって……。", "zh": "啊，青羽小姐！谢谢您。\n今天不知为何，多个日程撞在一起了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "33544703da5451b36e592a500df524e8ce0b54581ea8f926406272d0801a8da4", "ja": "ロケが長引いたせいで、もうひとつの仕事が\nアイドル達に任せきりになってしまったんです。", "zh": "因为外景拍摄拖延了，另一项工作就只能全都交给偶像们处理了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "4f3d24d4d84a62c91a576226b2be3536b62c14dbdc0e92592b14bbabcc8356b7", "ja": "大変な日だったんですね、お疲れさまです。\nもうひとつのお仕事、どんなお仕事だったんですか？", "zh": "真是辛苦的一天呢，您辛苦了。\n另一项工作，是什么样的工作呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8955e582f057bd37358f7f9da31ecabc3ec2a32819c04099dd3cdf5a083a83d6", "ja": "えっと……あれ？　もうひとつ……？", "zh": "呃……咦？另一个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "f761c7535e5f8575037e9add08dd049b35bc4b69e5a6ef6af3312b3afc0c6c77", "ja": "？　今、ロケと別のお仕事が重なってしまった……\nって、言ってませんでしたか？", "zh": "？你刚才是不是说，外景拍摄和另一份工作撞在一起了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e06633b2d5f776f5c8f04f3e2ff93982342fac9f9c9bc78edcb52343df5a5622", "ja": "あっ……はい、そうです。前にも仕事をした\nロリータブランドの依頼で……新作の……。", "zh": "啊……是的，没错。是之前也合作过的洛丽塔品牌委托的……新作的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "a65b1cc2fe097ddeba9c2b2052a1153d181ae717fcbf148765a1a272cfb18b46", "ja": "{$P$}さん？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8bb43c82a1b4aa5edc992b888700bf0c75132e91b4a6c72b236ac1f571df561d", "ja": "す、すみません。\nあれ……誰だったっけ。急に記憶が……。", "zh": "对、对不起。\n那个……你是谁来着？突然想不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "1083fe0fcb725a0cf96ed4d277ed1c66dbd5aa5586f45537a410157cea0ee56a", "ja": "ええっ、忘れちゃったんですか！？\nだ、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "诶诶，您把我忘了吗！？\n没、没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "239aa1a6bb58c2d275234413c6dc37f60526f877f2d843143372c252a1c36f16", "ja": "おかしいな……さっきまで、帰ったら\n皆の様子を確かめようと思ってたんですけど。", "zh": "真奇怪……刚才还想着回去后确认一下大家的情况来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f1da343b7a0bd860cfb7d08db3d6bbbf20afbbcb9fa49f0b8e1f1fe1aefb6720", "ja": "ユニットで受けた仕事で、確か、く……。\nくろ、がつく名前だったような……。", "zh": "通过组合接的工作，我记得好像是……带“黑……”的名字……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "88cdd1953d7ba18699973455cb3ebbd80e5517aff961bad4a1388eccf4b54f09", "ja": "く……くろ……\nうーん、『Clover』とか？", "zh": "黑……黑……\n嗯……是不是叫“Clover”之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1018_p", "source_sha256": "40335193ea758968d94752c2ee170c991542cfa78201f8cb02786b18f0eb55f1", "ja": "いえ、違いますね。\n確か5人のユニットだったような……。", "zh": "不，不对。记得好像是由5人组成的组合……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "c26580a6c17e36b5183227b9c6652271413c2151f7148e2547e5c90db3796bbb", "ja": "くろ……で始まる5人のユニット……。\nそんなユニット、あったでしょうか……？", "zh": "以“黑……”开头的5人组合……有过这样的组合吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2022a9a5664a728e9396fc82d2790fda3ac394cbc84f123fb1b0062b848e2c76", "ja": "勘違いだったのかな……。\n別の仕事、今日じゃなかったのかも。", "zh": "难道是我搞错了……  \n也许不是今天去做别的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1021_102mis", "source_sha256": "59e4a1cd195040a42b9259c39d6ec54c3fb01bd840a7b62edaa2ccc21c5da81f", "ja": "{$P$}さん……おそうめんに、\nミョウガをたくさん入れて食べたんじゃないですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……你是不是在素面里\n加了很多茗荷吃呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7179c438ceea0ad6a25718da574cbd3ba5b4147457c56eba9081d69a71a5784d", "ja": "えっ……いえ、そんな事は。\nそれに、まだそんな季節じゃないですから。", "zh": "咦……不，没那回事。\n而且，现在还没到那个季节呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "728404b085899d09a14dc4afaa399b627b3500b0e65b1b72878e7104890f9348", "ja": "（そう。俺はその仕事の現場には行けなかった。\nだからこれは、後から当事者に聞いた話となる……）", "zh": "（没错，我没能去那份工作的现场。\n所以，这些都是我后来听当事人说的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
